  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups white sugar",
    "1 cup butter, softened",
    "15 ounces ricotta cheese",
    "2 eggs",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract",
    "4 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2 tablespoons baking powder",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1.5 cups confectioners' sugar",
    "3 tablespoons milk"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/K61_zcw1SetyBy74_VQMn-Y_qIo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11361-RicottaCheeseCookies-ddmfs-Step1-3x4-8404-22c7804e646f4d85a715f6a4314c0e27.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11361/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Line baking sheets with parchment paper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat together sugar and butter in a large bowl with an electric mixer on low speed until combined. Increase speed to high and beat until light and fluffy, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3bZfHfxy8IrDJWlS1Ny7aZ1NQp0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11361-RicottaCheeseCookies-ddmfs-Step2-3x4-8405-cf08730b228e4311960d33c951213fc7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11361/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce speed to medium and beat in ricotta, eggs, and vanilla.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AweHi8N9wW8hWoOuVYYkd2xzwqQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11361-RicottaCheeseCookies-ddmfs-Step2-3x4-8408-f1478ab2c2a8481b953bafa26aa647f3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11361/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce speed to low. Add flour, baking powder, and salt; beat until dough forms.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ghWNo8eLMJ9BzV1F8zfYBOvH3w8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11361-RicottaCheeseCookies-ddmfs-Step3-3x4-8411-ad703431590c496691eb5c909c7dd535.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11361/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drop level tablespoonfuls of dough 2 inches apart onto the prepared baking sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/te0b3FT61uJWLHcqFbQOxbI16Ts=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11361-RicottaCheeseCookies-ddmfs-Step4-3x4-8413-6cb0144a772b4000b1a52ec0105cd797.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11361/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until cookies are very lightly golden and soft, about 15 minutes. Use a spatula to remove cookies to a wire rack to cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "When cookies are cool, make glaze: Stir together confectioners' sugar and milk in a small bowl until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZnB8beH1swEedH3SHfe2O1y1bBY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11361-RicottaCheeseCookies-ddmfs-Step5-3x4-8419-1b98a3f3b344459db34acd81766a4abf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11361/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use a small spoon or spatula to spread glaze on cookies; alternatively, dip each cookie into the bowl of glaze. Decorate as desired.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bbTl5hjacN7Pvumi1Rga2c7diCM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11361-RicottaCheeseCookies-ddmfs-Step6-3x4-8436-c6be84f5e1d2449aba77d605ced6d2f3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11361/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
